# Every discoverable area of Alterac Mountains, Arathi Highlands, Badlands,
# Riverglades, Swamp of Sorrows, Stranglethorn Vale (97 map overlays), for both
# factions. Each `explore` point is the centre of the area's map overlay hit
# rect in the Forever client's tables (WorldMapOverlay, UiMapXMapArt, UiMap,
# AreaTable via wago.tools, build 1.60.1.70338), in the map's live frame
# (written `live` where Forever moved the map or added it, else the Era frame it
# equals); area levels are AreaTable.ExplorationLevel; flight masters come from
# data/forever/travel.json. Zone order and travel lines are
# tools/lib/exploration/spec.js; inside a zone the areas are a shortest tour
# from where you arrive towards the next zone.

step Alterac Mountains (1/2)
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Starts in the Alterac Mountains, north of Hillsbrad Foothills, and ends in Stranglethorn Vale. 15 areas to discover here, levels 27-39.
  note "Exploring the entire world map on one character is a Forever Legacy Challenge (1 account-wide Legacy Point)."
  note "Fly to Southshore in Hillsbrad Foothills and walk north into the Alterac Mountains." only Alliance
  note "Fly to Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad Foothills and walk north into the Alterac Mountains." only Horde
