step Riverglades (1/2)
  zone Riverglades
  tip 14 areas to discover here, levels 36-44. Flight paths: Farholde Keep in the south-east (Alliance), Rog'mar in the middle (Horde).
  note "From the south of the Badlands, past Agmond's End, a way leads down into the Riverglades by Twilight's Shroud. (The Riverglades also open off northern Redridge through Blackrock Pass, and a ship runs from Steamwheedle Port in Tanaris to Powderfuse Port, the neutral goblin port on its coast.) Krol'dok Stronghold is an ogre clan's outdoor dungeon."
